<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;HINDUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hindus represent a religious group comprising 16.00% of the population."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KALIGANJ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kaliganj is a place in Gazipur district with a literacy rate of 59.81% and a sex ratio of 991 females per 1000 males. It is known for its religious diversity and has a population of 175,915 as of the 1991 Bangladesh census."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GAZIPUR DISTRICT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gazipur district is a district in Bangladesh where Kaliganj is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BHAWAL CATHOLICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bhawal Catholics are a Christian community in Kaliganj, converted by the Portuguese in the 17th century."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PORTUGUESE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Portuguese are credited with converting the Bhawal Catholics in the 17th century."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KING SHASHANKA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"King Shashanka was a ruler in the 7th century, whose death marked the beginning of a new era in the region."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SHASHANKA OF GAUR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Shashanka of Gaur was another ruler in the 7th century, whose death also marked the start of a new era."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMPEROR HARSHAVARDHANA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Emperor Harshavardhana ruled the region after the deaths of King Shashanka and Shashanka of Gaur in the 7th century."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KING YASHOVARDHANA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"King Yashovardhana was the ruler of Kanaujar who conquered the kingdoms of Gaur and Bengal in the 725-735 AD period."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PALA DYNASTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pala dynasty ruled Jhenaidah from 781-821 AD after the fall of the previous rulers."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BURMESE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Burmese ruled the Jhenaidah region from 1080-1150 AD after defeating the Pala dynasty."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;79%&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"79% represents a percentage, though context is missing, it could refer to some statistical measure or percentage of a certain metric."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SERVICE 15.84%&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Service 15.84% likely refers to a specific service or category within a larger dataset or percentage breakdown."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OTHERS 8.77%&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Others 8.77% represents a percentage of a category or metric, possibly referring to miscellaneous or unspecified elements."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGE 7 AND OVER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Age 7 and over refers to a demographic group defined by age criteria."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL AVERAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"National average refers to a general statistic applicable to the entire country, in this case, the literacy rate of 51.8%."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;URBAN AREAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Urban areas refer to the portion of the population living in urban settings, specifically 45,430 (17.13%) in Kaliganj."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHRISTIAN COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Christian community refers to a religious group in Kaliganj, specifically the Bhawal Catholics."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PORTUGAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Portugal is mentioned as the country that converted the Bhawal Catholics in the 17th century."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BANGLADESH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bangladesh is the country where Kaliganj and other locations are situated."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORLDOMETER’S RTS ALGORITHM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Worldometer’s RTS algorithm is used to continuously update the population estimate of Bangladesh."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED NATIONS POPULATION DIVISION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"United Nations Population Division provides the data used by Worldometer’s RTS algorithm to estimate the population of Bangladesh."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ASIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Asia is mentioned as a reference point for comparing the population of Bangladesh."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WORLD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"World is mentioned as a reference point for comparing the population of Bangladesh."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;7TH CENTURY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"7th century refers to a specific time period in history when various rulers and events took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;725-735 AD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"725-735 AD is a specific time period when King Yashovardhana conquered the kingdoms of Gaur and Bengal."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;781-821 AD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"781-821 AD is a specific time period when Jhenaidah belonged to the Pala dynasty."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1080-1150 AD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1080-1150 AD is a specific time period when the Burmese ruled the Jhenaidah region."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BURMAN DYNASTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Burman dynasty is mentioned as a ruling entity before being defeated."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JHENAIDAH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jhenaidah is a location in Bangladesh that has been ruled by various dynasties and empires throughout history."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BANGANTHA AND SAMATAT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bangantha and Samatat are mentioned as regions that were part of the state before the 7th century."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;KALIGANJ&quot;" target="&quot;BHAWAL CATHOLICS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Bhawal Catholics are a part of the Christian community in Kaliganj, converted by the Portuguese in the 17th century."</data>
      <data key="d5">"religious community, conversion"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KALIGANJ&quot;" target="&quot;PORTUGUESE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Portuguese are credited with converting the Bhawal Catholics in the 17th century, which is related to Kaliganj."</data>
      <data key="d5">"conversion, historical influence"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;KING SHASHANKA&quot;" target="&quot;EMPEROR HARSHAVARDHANA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Emperor Harshavardhana ruled the region after the deaths of King Shashanka and Shashanka of Gaur in the 7th century, marking a new era."</data>
      <data key="d5">"succession, new era"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;EMPEROR HARSHAVARDHANA&quot;" target="&quot;KING YASHOVARDHANA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"King Yashovardhana conquered the kingdoms of Gaur and Bengal during the period 725-735 AD, which is related to Emperor Harshavardhana's rule."</data>
      <data key="d5">"conquest, rule"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PALA DYNASTY&quot;" target="&quot;BURMESE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Burmese ruled the Jhenaidah region from 1080-1150 AD after defeating the Pala dynasty, indicating a change in governance."</data>
      <data key="d5">"defeat, governance"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0480-c2019d29e2de</data>
    </edge>
